    "detailed_description": "Are you ready to take an adventure with an alligator and a fox inside a transforming monster truck? Does the alligator even have a driving license? The destination is unknown, but Rallygator will surely reach it!<br><br>In this physics-based platformer game, you control a multi-functional, transforming monster truck. Solve puzzles and perform tricky stunts.<br><br>Hop and drive around in car mode, dive into the deep waters in submarine mode, or turn into a mini-truck to navigate tight spaces. Rallygator is full of surprises!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Features</h2><br>    Ever-changing and challenging gameplay<br>    Physics-driven gameplay, including character animations<br>    Adorable cartoon graphics<br>    Support for both controller and keyboard play.&quot;",
